* broken.cos — deliberately invalid CAOS for diagnostics testing
* (plan/07-demo-app-and-verification.md edge cases). Three distinct kinds
* of error on purpose: unknown command, wrong argument type, unterminated
* DOIF.

scrp 1 1 1 0

* Unknown command
zzzz 1 2 3

* Wrong argument type (SETV's 2nd param wants a decimal, not a string)
setv va00 "not a number"

* Unterminated DOIF (no matching ENDI before ENDM)
doif va00 eq 0
  outs "never closed\n"

endm
